---
/**
 * p60 · Plozz — Basin
 *
 * A receiver and a display in one body: a round shell cradles a square picture,
 * the way a dish holds whatever falls into it, and the light gathers in its
 * upper-left as light does in any bowl. Nothing draws the signal.
 *
 * Eleven blue tones. The shell is banded off its own distance field, so every
 * band curves with the silhouette; the reflection is a crescent hugging the
 * rim, thinning away from the key light in both directions. The face sits on
 * the plain screen tone with a pixel of air all round.
 */
